 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Within His Grasp [Rebirth]"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh-ro": "Zài Tā Zhǎng Zhōng [Chóngshēng]"
   },
   {
    "zh": "在他掌中[重生]"
   },
   {
    "en": "In His Hands [Rebirth]"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In their past life, Wen Yu deeply loved Ji Anning. However, his overbearing and reckless nature led her to misunderstand and fear him. And after she accidentally fell from a building, Wen Yu, consumed by revenge, ended up in prison. \n\nAfter she was reborn, Ji Anning did everything she could to avoid Wen Yu, determined not to repeat the same tragic mistakes. But through his unwavering pursuit, she slowly came to understand the depth of his feelings. \n\nAs he faced difficult times, she offered him comfort and support. In the end, after enduring so much, the two stood side by side—ready to face whatever life threw at them and determined to change their fate together."
  },
